// 13 VARIABLES - syntax rules

cant use keywords or reserved words
cant start with a number
no special characters other than $ and _
= is for assignment
; means end of instruction 


//13 VARIABLES - Updating values

Do not need to use let again.
Syntax: variable = variable + 1
Assignment Operator is used = 
Short Hand Assignment Operators:
+=, -=, *=, /=, ++


